  {
   "id": "squirrel-with-a-gun-213473@major-2025-12-04",
   "gameId": "squirrel-with-a-gun-213473",
   "displayName": "The Varmint Update is Here!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-12-04T17:02:05.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "It's time to get wild with the Varmint Update! 🦝",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "With the Varmint Update you can",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Collect special Varmint furs that transform you into different critters! Become a Cat With A Gun, a Raccoon With A Gun, a Possum With A Gun, and many more!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Do battle with sentient Trash Monsters that appear around the neighborhood.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Explore 4 new bunkers with 10 golden acorns and exotic Varmint Furs. Please note that some of these are outdoor bunkers.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Play a deadly game of Red-Light-Green-Light, climb a gigantic stone squirrel statue, or run around a rat's giant cage that's more sinister than it appears.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Go on a neighborhood-wide egg hunt for another fabulous furry prize!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/42666094/34dc15a0ec19f4d7c27083731af95c0569f9d074.gif\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "New Game Plus is now also available, too! You can replay cutscenes with any outfit and level up your Reload Wheels beyond a single play through's limits. Additionally, every New Game Plus you start will gives you an extra max bullet for every gun. Try out our venerable Varmint Update today!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Watch the Varmint Update trailer here",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Be sure to tag us if you share your favorite new skin on socials and follow Squirrel with a Gun on X to stay up-to-date!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/42666094/11412641bc6908d2e8a1ba6942140164f7d105f0.jpg\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
